Yella kra n yisallen meqqren deg umaḍal
Yella kra n yisallen ixataren igraɣlanen
Yella kra n yisallen meqqren deg umaḍal meṛṛa
Efk-iyi-d amaynut n yisallen imaḍlanen
Efk-iyi-d amaynut n yisallen igraɣlanen
Efk-iyi-d amaynut n yisallen n umaḍal
Efk-iyi-d isallen ineggura n umaḍal meṛṛa
