Efk-iyi-d isallen igraɣlanen
Efk-iyi-d isallen n umaḍal
Efk-iyi-d isallen n umaḍal meṛṛa
Amek yella umaḍal ass-a
Bɣiɣ isallen imaḍlanen
Bɣiɣ isallen igraɣlanen
Bɣiɣ isallen n umaḍal
Bɣiɣ isallen n umaḍal meṛṛa
Llan yisallen iḥemlen imaḍlanen
Llan yisallen iḥemlen igraɣlanen
Llan yisallen iḥemlen deg umaḍal meṛṛa
Ini-yi-d ɣef yisallen imaḍlanen
Ini-yi-d ɣef yisallen igraɣlanen
Ini-yi-d ɣef yisallen n umaḍal
Ini-yi-d ɣef yisallen n umaḍal meṛṛa
Ini-yi-d dacu i yellan deg umaḍal
Ini-yi-d dacu i d-yeḍran deg umaḍal meṛṛa
Dacu i yeḍran deg umaḍal
Dacu i yeḍran deg umaḍal tura
Dacu n yisallen igraɣlanen i yellan
Dacu i yellan d amaynu deg yisallen imaḍlanen
Dacu i yellan d amaynu deg yisallen igraɣlanen
Dacu i yellan d amaynu deg yisallen n umaḍal
